{{!
    @template local_groupdist/group_picture

    The group's current picture, for the read-only Current picture row of the
    group settings modal. Deliberately not a link: core's print_group_picture
    wraps the image in a link to the participants list for anyone holding
    moodle/site:accessallgroups even when asked not to, and following it from
    inside the modal would discard the unsaved form.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * url string The group picture URL.
    * name string The group name, already formatted for output.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/12/group/icon/7/f1",
        "name": "Group A"
    }
}}
<img src="{{url}}" alt="{{name}}" title="{{name}}" class="local-groupdist-curpic rounded">
